  m_Name: Rami_Dialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  npcName: Chef Rami
  Lines:
  - This is NOT how you act in a five-star restaurant, punk! NOT HOW YOU ACT!
  - "You\u2019re fired! I\u2019m sick of you! I don\u2019t care if you\u2019re the
    best chef we have\u2026you are USELESS."
  - " I\u2019ll find a replacement in three seconds, just you wait and see."
  - "There is a 100% chance that the festival will be a disaster like last year if
    you are the chef! I bet youre from Co Lu\u2026"
  - HEY, YOU! How would you like to be a chef for the festival?
  - "You can\u2019t do any worse than this imbecile I had before."
  - "Tell you what, if you do well, I\u2019ll give you this sheet metal we\u2019ve
    got lying around."
  - So what do you say?
  - "Yes? See, replaced in three seconds! You start in five minutes, kid. We\u2019re
    on a tight schedule."
  - Just head inside the Bistro and I'll show you the ropes
  - No? Whatever. I'm sure you would have sucked as a chef anyway.
  - Come back here when you change your mind!
  - What'd I tell you? head inside the bistro!
  - Ah you're back. You ready to cook?
  - Excellent! Just head inside the Bistro and I'll show you the ropes
  - This is... DELICIOUS!! Wow, kid you really know how to make a mean stew!
  - This is going to be such a hit at the festival!
  - As promised, heres that repair part I told you about.
  - And hey, if you ever need a part time job as a chef, you know where to find me!
